claim.claim-text:
receiving, by a border gateway protocol, BGP, peer node, a segment routing, SR, prefix segment identifier, SID, associated with a prefix;
receiving, by the BGP peer node, a flexible algorithm definition, FAD;
determining, by the BGP peer node and using the FAD received, a next hop in a route towards a destination identified by the prefix;
allocating a local label for the prefix;
associating the local label with the determined next hop for the prefix; and
storing, in a forwarding information base, FIB, of the BGP peer node, the next hop determined, wherein the act of storing, in the FIB of the BGP peer node, the next hop determined includes associating with the next hop, in the FIB, the prefix and the local label allocated.

